#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.6.rst:4
msgid "v4.8.6"
msgstr "v4.8.6"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.6.rst:6
msgid ""
"v4.8.6 is a connectivity and tooling release focused on high-speed camera "
"firmware loading, smarter framebuffer streaming, and updated AI/toolchain "
"bundles. It remains based on Qt Creator 14.0.2. There are no breaking "
"changes for existing user projects."
msgstr ""
"v4.8.6 是一個著重於連線能力與工具鏈的版本，聚焦於高速相機韌體載入、更聰明的影格緩衝區串流，以及更新的 AI／工具鏈套件。它仍以 Qt "
"Creator 14.0.2 為基礎。對現有的使用者專案並無破壞性變更。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.6.rst:14
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "本頁內容"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.6.rst:17
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "重點項目"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.6.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Reliable macOS firmware loading** for high-speed RT1062 and Alif AE3 "
"cameras running the V4.8.1 V1 DBG protocol, by working around a TinyUSB "
"high-speed USB lockup."
msgstr ""
"**可靠的 macOS 韌體載入**\\ ，適用於執行 V4.8.1 V1 DBG 協定的高速 RT1062 與 Alif AE3 相機，方法是繞過一個"
" TinyUSB 高速 USB 鎖死問題。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.6.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Automatic JPEG vs raw streaming** that picks JPEG when the camera runs at "
"full speed or has a hardware JPEG encoder, and raw only when the camera is "
"high-speed and lacks a JPEG encoder, remembering the choice per board."
msgstr ""
"**自動選擇 JPEG 或原始串流**\\ ，當相機以全速執行或具備硬體 JPEG 編碼器時選擇 JPEG，僅在相機為高速且缺少 JPEG "
"編碼器時選擇原始格式，並會針對每個開發板記住此選擇。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.6.rst:25
msgid ""
"**Alif ROM/Recovery-mode recovery** during firmware loading, driving the "
"maintenance tool and prompting for a power cycle."
msgstr "**Alif ROM／Recovery 模式復原**\\ ，在韌體載入期間驅動維護工具並提示進行電源重新開機。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.6.rst:27
msgid ""
"**ST Edge AI tools updated to STEDGEAI 3.0.0** and the Arm GNU bare-metal "
"toolchain to ``14.3.rel1``."
msgstr ""
"**ST Edge AI 工具更新至 STEDGEAI 3.0.0**\\ ，且 Arm GNU 裸機工具鏈更新至 ``14.3.rel1``\\ 。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.6.rst:29
msgid ""
"**csi_ng auto-fixups** so example scripts adapt resolution and pixel format "
"to the attached sensor using the new ``csi.*`` API."
msgstr "**csi_ng 自動修正**\\ ，使範例指令碼能透過新的 ``csi.*`` API 將解析度與像素格式調整為符合所連接的感測器。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.6.rst:33
msgid "New features"
msgstr "新功能"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.6.rst:35
msgid ""
"The IDE now automatically picks JPEG versus raw framebuffer streaming based "
"on the connected board's capabilities: it prefers JPEG when the camera runs "
"at full speed or has a hardware JPEG encoder, and only falls back to raw "
"when the camera is high-speed and lacks a JPEG encoder. The per-board choice"
" is remembered between sessions (`64823318a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/64823318a>`__)."
msgstr ""
"IDE 現在會根據所連接開發板的能力自動選擇 JPEG 或原始影格緩衝區串流：當相機以全速執行或具備硬體 JPEG 編碼器時偏好 "
"JPEG，僅在相機為高速且缺少 JPEG 編碼器時才退回原始格式。每個開發板的選擇會在工作階段之間記住（\\ `64823318a "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/64823318a>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.6.rst:41
msgid ""
"Alif firmware loading can now detect and recover a board that comes up in "
"ROM/Recovery mode, driving the maintenance tool through recovery and "
"prompting the user to power-cycle the camera afterward (`617724b4e "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/617724b4e>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Alif 韌體載入現在可以偵測並復原一個以 ROM／Recovery "
"模式啟動的開發板，驅動維護工具完成復原流程，並在之後提示使用者對相機進行電源重新開機（\\ `617724b4e "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/617724b4e>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.6.rst:47
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "其他變更與改進"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.6.rst:49
msgid ""
"Grayscale and HM01B0/Boson/GENX320 sensor auto-fixups now also rewrite the "
"new ``csi_ng`` API calls (``.pixformat(csi.*)`` / ``.framesize(csi.*)``) so "
"examples adapt resolution and pixel format to the attached sensor "
"(`11a3e0d37 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/11a3e0d37>`__)."
msgstr ""
"灰階以及 HM01B0/Boson/GENX320 感測器的自動修正現在也會改寫新的 ``csi_ng`` API 呼叫（\\ "
"``.pixformat(csi.*)`` / ``.framesize(csi.*)``\\ "
"），使範例能將解析度與像素格式調整為符合所連接的感測器（\\ `11a3e0d37 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/11a3e0d37>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.6.rst:55
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "錯誤修正"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.6.rst:57
msgid ""
"Firmware loading for high-speed RT1062 and Alif AE3 cameras running the "
"V4.8.1 V1 DBG protocol now connects reliably on macOS by splitting the "
"protocol-version check packet to work around a TinyUSB high-speed USB lockup"
" (`4b558274d <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/4b558274d>`__)."
msgstr ""
"執行 V4.8.1 V1 DBG 協定的高速 RT1062 與 Alif AE3 相機的韌體載入，現在於 macOS "
"上能可靠地連接，方法是拆分協定版本檢查封包以繞過一個 TinyUSB 高速 USB 鎖死問題（\\ `4b558274d "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/4b558274d>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.6.rst:61
msgid ""
"Matching the camera's USB serial drive now also accepts a byte-reversed "
"serial number, fixing drive detection on boards that report the serial in "
"reversed byte order (`633f5e559 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/633f5e559>`__)."
msgstr ""
"配對相機的 USB 序列磁碟時，現在也接受位元組順序反轉的序號，修正了在以反轉位元組順序回報序號的開發板上的磁碟偵測問題（\\ `633f5e559 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/633f5e559>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.6.rst:65
msgid ""
"On macOS the editor tabs are now forced to align to the left of the tab bar "
"instead of stretching or centering (`5a25d12ed "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/5a25d12ed>`__, `6f4139739 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/6f4139739>`__)."
msgstr ""
"在 macOS 上，編輯器分頁現在被強制對齊至分頁列的左側，而不再延展或置中（\\ `5a25d12ed "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/5a25d12ed>`__\\ 、\\ `6f4139739 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/6f4139739>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.6.rst:71
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "平台與工具支援"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.6.rst:73
msgid "**Qt Creator base:** 14.0.2."
msgstr "**Qt Creator 基礎版本：** 14.0.2。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.6.rst:74
msgid ""
"**ST Edge AI tools** updated to STEDGEAI 3.0.0 (from 2.1.0) for Windows, "
"macOS-arm, and Linux64, with the ``OPENMV_N6`` neuralart profile dropping "
"the ``--mvei`` option; the STEDGEAI download URL was also moved to "
"``download.openmv.io`` (`c7560debb <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c7560debb>`__, `5fd08b8b6 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/5fd08b8b6>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**ST Edge AI 工具** 已針對 Windows、macOS-arm 與 Linux64 更新至 STEDGEAI 3.0.0（自 "
"2.1.0），其中 ``OPENMV_N6`` neuralart 設定檔移除了 ``--mvei`` 選項；STEDGEAI 下載 URL 也已移至 "
"``download.openmv.io``\\ （\\ `c7560debb <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c7560debb>`__\\ 、\\ `5fd08b8b6 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/5fd08b8b6>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.6.rst:80
msgid ""
"**Arm GNU bare-metal toolchain** updated to ``14.3.rel1`` (from "
"``14.2.rel1``) (`c7560debb <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c7560debb>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Arm GNU 裸機工具鏈** 已更新至 ``14.3.rel1``\\ （自 ``14.2.rel1``\\ ）（\\ `c7560debb "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c7560debb>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.6.rst:85
msgid "Breaking changes"
msgstr "破壞性變更"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.6.rst:87
msgid ""
"None. This release is fully compatible with existing OpenMV IDE projects and"
" workflows."
msgstr "無。此版本與現有的 OpenMV IDE 專案及工作流程完全相容。"
